Stage 29 — Common Unreal Investigation Mistakes

Avoid

Treating Unreal like a conventional Android application.

Ignoring the reflection system.

Confusing generated reflection code with handwritten gameplay logic.

Focusing on individual Actors before understanding the gameplay framework.

Mixing engine responsibilities with game-specific systems.

Ignoring module boundaries and asset organization.



---

Stage 30 — Unreal APK Methodology Master Checklist

By the end of this stage, you should be able to:

✅ Identify Unreal Engine applications and profile their engine architecture.

✅ Reconstruct gameplay frameworks, UObject hierarchies, Actors, Components, and Blueprint relationships.

✅ Understand world management, rendering, animation, physics, AI, and networking at an architectural level.

✅ Recover asset organization, persistence, module structure, and plugin integration.

✅ Trace interactions between Unreal, Android, and platform services.

✅ Distinguish engine infrastructure from handwritten gameplay logic.

✅ Validate reconstructed architecture using runtime observations.

✅ Produce comprehensive documentation describing the Unreal application's architecture, execution model, and gameplay systems.



